      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/readme/cover-en-mobile.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/readme/cover-en.png\" alt=\"dsh-kanban — Plan together. See work move. A shared board for you and your agent in DeepSeek Harness.\" width=\"100%\">\n  </picture>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@alpacachen/dsh-kanban\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/@alpacachen/dsh-kanban?style=flat-square&color=3867e8&label=npm\" alt=\"npm version\"></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-3867e8?style=flat-square\" alt=\"MIT license\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com\"><img src=\"https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/badge.svg\" alt=\"Awesome DSH Plugin\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"README.zh.md\">简体中文</a> · <strong>English</strong><br>\n  <a href=\"#get-started\">Get started</a> · <a href=\"docs/guide.md\">User guide</a> · <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agent-tool-reference\">Agent tools</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\nTurn plans from your conversations into tasks you can move forward. You and your agent share one board for planning, context, and progress, all inside DeepSeek Harness."
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\"><sub>Current plugin UI · Isolated demo data · A separate board for every workspace</sub></p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Describe the goal. Let your agent create the tasks.",
      "text": "Ask your agent to break down a requirement, write implementation steps and acceptance criteria, and assign labels and priorities. With 19 built-in tools, the plan goes straight onto the board.\n\n> Break phone sign-in into testable tasks. Check existing cards first to avoid duplicates. Write implementation steps and acceptance criteria for each card, and mark launch blockers as P0."
    },
    {
      "section": "See the progress. Take over at any time.",
